          "comment": "# Bullet Points to Press Release\n\nTurns a list of facts into a structured press release with headline, dateline, body, quote and boilerplate. The quote is attributed to a role, so the model does not invent a named spokesperson.\n\n**How it works:** Enter the facts in \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" writes the release in standard structure with a closing boilerplate placeholder. \"3 Output\" shows the text.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on the Agent and add a target length, such as \"under 300 words\", to its system prompt."
